{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/pulls/10361","id":3386732162,"node_id":"PR_kwDOASa_i87J3W6C","html_url":"https://github.com/monero-project/monero/pull/10361","diff_url":"https://github.com/monero-project/monero/pull/10361.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/monero-project/monero/pull/10361.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/issues/10361","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/pulls/10361/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/pulls/10361/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/issues/10361/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/statuses/3d3ed652469b0ce1852f47e8ded55b97bae60cc2","number":10361,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"FCMP++: tower cycle Curve class + hash_grow implementation + tests","user":{"login":"j-berman","id":26468430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDY4NDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26468430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman","html_url":"https://github.com/j-berman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-berman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Builds on top of:\r\n- #10360\r\n\r\nThe Curve class is an abstract interface for curves that form a cycle with another curve. This commit implements the [Helios and Selene](https://gist.github.com/tevador/4524c2092178df08996487d4e272b096) classes inherited from the Curve parent class.\r\n\r\nThis commit tests the `hash_grow` flow under circumstances that occur when the curve trees merkle tree grows.\r\n\r\nIt implements all the necessary functions on the Helios and Selene classes:\r\n- `hash_init_point`\r\n- `hash_grow`\r\n- `zero_scalar`\r\n- `to_bytes(Scalar)`\r\n- `to_bytes(Point)`\r\n- `to_string(Scalar)`\r\n- `to_string(Point)`\r\n\r\nIt introduces new Rust FFI compatible C structs:\r\n- `HeliosScalar` compatible with [`HelioseleneField`](https://github.com/monero-oxide/monero-oxide/blob/92af05e0d44bd1ec1fed6028a8d2aade615f805a/crypto/helioselene/src/field.rs#L20)\r\n- `HeliosPoint` compatible with this [`HeliosPoint`](https://github.com/monero-oxide/monero-oxide/blob/92af05e0d44bd1ec1fed6028a8d2aade615f805a/crypto/helioselene/src/point.rs#L448)\r\n- `SelenePoint` compatible with this [`SelenePoint`](https://github.com/monero-oxide/monero-oxide/blob/92af05e0d44bd1ec1fed6028a8d2aade615f805a/crypto/helioselene/src/point.rs#L486)\r\n- Slices compatible with respective slices.\r\n\r\nAnd introduces new Rust FFI functions:\r\n- `helios_hash_init_point`\r\n- `selene_hash_init_point`\r\n- `helios_zero_scalar`\r\n- `selene_zero_scalar`\r\n- `helios_scalar_to_bytes`\r\n- `selene_scalar_to_bytes`\r\n- `helios_point_to_bytes`\r\n- `selene_point_to_bytes`\r\n- `hash_grow_helios`\r\n- `hash_grow_selene`\r\n\r\nNotably we also instantiate the `CurveTreesV1` object with expected production widths in order to use it in tests.","labels":[{"id":8103353753,"node_id":"LA_kwDOASa_i88AAAAB4v9dmQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monero-project/monero/labels/fcmp++","name":"fcmp++","description":"","color":"7229CA","default":false}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-11T23:39:46Z","up